{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39762","headline":"省试奉诏涨曲江池 · 黄滔","name":"省试奉诏涨曲江池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地脉寒来浅，恩波住後新。\n引将诸派水，别贮大都春。\n幽咽疏通处，清泠迸入辰。\n渐平连杏岸，旋阔映楼津。\n沙没迷行径，洲宽恣跃鳞。\n愿当舟檝便，一附济川人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}